  - tools/pg5tool.py, test/sim: from Chess 47, TERM47, ZX47 and HP47 (same author, GPL v3).
  - third_party/peanut_gb/peanut_gb.h: Peanut-GB 1.3.0 by Mahyar Koshkouei, MIT License (third_party/peanut_gb/LICENSE;
    parts from SameBoy, MIT, Lior Halphon). Unchanged.
